; line: R0 = tokenak, R1 = kopurua (etiketarik gabe) -> agindu-lerro bat
line:
PUSH R8
PUSH R9
PUSH R10
PUSH R11
PUSH R12
PUSH R13
PUSH R14
PUSH R15
PUSH R16
PUSH R17
PUSH R18
